  unitName: Mysterious Knight (EU)
  unitId: 740165
  unitNumber: 7119
  description: "Every day he seems to be getting stronger. Something powerful must
    be driving the Mysterious Knight\u2019s ambitions as he seems to grow in strength
    quite rapidly. There are days where he goes off into the forests to train, and
    does not allow anyone to follow him. Nobody knows what he does out there, but
    after every day he seems more determined to accomplish his goal. As long as he
    is loyal to Arthur, the other knights tolerate his behavior. However, one cannot
    stop but think what this Mysterious Knight\u2019s true intentions really are\u2026"
  summonDesc: My destiny is great and so am I! I will defeat anyone who dares stand
    in my way!
  fusionDesc: "Power\u2026 To fulfill my destiny, I need more power!"
  evoDesc: My destiny is great and so am I! I will defeat anyone who dares stand
    in my way!
